flowchart TD
    A[Lead Form / Webhook] --> B[Validate Payload]
    B --> C{Valid?}
    C -- No --> D[Reject + Log Error]
    C -- Yes --> E[Deduplicate Lead]
    E --> F{Duplicate?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Mark Duplicate + Archive]
    F -- No --> H[Enrich Lead Data]
    H --> I[Score Lead]
    I --> J{Qualified?}
    J -- No --> K[Store as Nurture Lead]
    J -- Yes --> L[Send to CRM]
    L --> M[Notify Sales Team]
    M --> N[Log Success]
